    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>TDP4: Team Battle</strong> - a Free-To-Play 2D multiplayer platformer shooter game with RPG elements! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >* Features various game modes: Deathmatch (DM), Team Deathmatch (TDM), Capture the Flag (CTF), Last Man Standing (LMS), Elimination (ELM) and Duel mode! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >* More than 40 different weapons: from pistols to futuristic laser weapons!  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >* Powerful skill system. Train your character to become stronger! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >* Obtain medals and in-game currency prizes for completing different achievements. Get high rating to become the best in TDP4 and the most respected!  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >* Create your own or join an existing clan. Fight for your clan mates and earn rating! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Try TDP4: Team Battle right now! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Join the game today!  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >2D Shooter  </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Various game types  </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >RPG skills system  </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tournaments system   </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Clan system   </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Achievements</p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>TDP4: Team Battle</strong> - a Free-To-Play 2D multiplayer platformer shooter game with RPG elements! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >* Features various game modes: Deathmatch (DM), Team Deathmatch (TDM), Capture the Flag (CTF), Last Man Standing (LMS), Elimination (ELM) and Duel mode! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >* More than 40 different weapons: from pistols to futuristic laser weapons!  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >* Powerful skill system. Train your character to become stronger! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >* Obtain medals and in-game currency prizes for completing different achievements. Get high rating to become the best in TDP4 and the most respected!  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >* Create your own or join an existing clan. Fight for your clan mates and earn rating! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Try TDP4: Team Battle right now! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Join the game today!  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >2D Shooter  </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Various game types  </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >RPG skills system  </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tournaments system   </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Clan system   </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Achievements</p></li></ul>",
    "short_description": "TDP4 Team Battle is a real-time multiplayer 2D shooter game with MMORPG elements. The bloody battle for survival among 3 races. There are various types of matches, locations and types of guns. Developed Clan and Tournament system. Test your skills against real enemies!",
